## Learning highlights

- **Declarative pipelines:** Implemented data collection, quality validation, and incremental processing with just a few lines of SQL.
- **Define KPI once:** Once you define a KPI in Metric View, {{ 'the dashboard, SQL, and Genie' if N.dash else 'SQL, Genie, and every agent that calls Genie over MCP' }} all use the same number.
- **Standardize terminology:** Domain and Pages ensure the business team uses business terms with consistent meaning across the organization.
- **Measurable AI quality:** Monitoring and Benchmark help you find why the AI is wrong, and measure the improvement with numbers.
{% if s.options.volumes %}
- **Structured + unstructured:** Volumes enable analyzing documents alongside data.
{% endif %}
{% if N.mcp %}
- **Genie as a tool:** Over MCP, your product, your own agents and coding agents reuse the same governed answers, with Unity Catalog permissions on every call.
- **Governed AI traffic:** Unity Gateway controls who can call the Genie One MCP, caps call volume, and records every call in `system.ai_gateway.usage`.
{% endif %}

